# Assembling an image needs the trust anchor and the /etc seeding step: every
# package comes off the repository server over HTTPS.
#
# This file is a deny-everything allowlist, so a new COPY in the Dockerfile
# needs a line here or it fails with "file not found in build context" -- which
# reads as a missing file rather than an excluded one.
*
!packages/server/duct.key.pub
!images/scripts/seed-etc.sh
